  "purpose_context": "Today an implementer resubmitting rework after a rejection, and a reviewer approving it, both need --force because of the agent-ownership guard, and the forced resubmission is misclassified as an arbiter override (rejected → overridden). This mission makes the ordinary rework loop unforced and restricts arbiter-override recording to genuine arbiter actions (#5196; parent epic #3044).",
